    {"type":"text","id":"callout_text","x":250,"y":695,"width":1280,"height":110,"text":"The whole point of the clock dial: ask \"what did Avery's inbox look like at 7:00 AM Tue May 21?\"\nand the emulator only shows mail timestamped before then. Friday's emails stay hidden until\nyou turn the dial to Friday. The digest agent can't peek at the future. That's how we grade it.","originalText":"The whole point of the clock dial: ask \"what did Avery's inbox look like at 7:00 AM Tue May 21?\"\nand the emulator only shows mail timestamped before then. Friday's emails stay hidden until\nyou turn the dial to Friday. The digest agent can't peek at the future. That's how we grade it.","fontSize":14,"fontFamily":3,"textAlign":"center","verticalAlign":"middle","strokeColor":"#7c2d12","backgroundColor":"transparent","fillStyle":"solid","strokeWidth":1,"strokeStyle":"solid","roughness":0,"opacity":100,"angle":0,"seed":260002,"version":1,"versionNonce":260002,"isDeleted":false,"groupIds":[],"boundElements":null,"link":null,"locked":false,"containerId":"callout","lineHeight":1.4}
